Package: siteconfig
Title: Site Configuration of R for HPC Environments
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
  person(
    "Henrik", "Bengtsson",
    email = "henrik.bengtsson@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7579-5165")
  ))
Description: Utilities for configuring R on a high-performance compute (HPC)
    environment, controlled by environment variables. Infers the default
    Bioconductor version, sets the default CRAN and Bioconductor package
    repositories, and falls back to local mirrors on the file system when
    there is no internet access, e.g. when environment variable
    'NO_INTERNET' is 'true'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports: utils
Suggests: BiocManager, BiocVersion
